OL,3,ADolly Parton free book scheme to expand
OL,4,Ain London
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton's Imagination Library,
OL,7,Fwhich posts children a free book every
OL,8,Fmonth until their fifth birthday, is to
OL,9,Fdouble the number of London boroughs it
OL,10,Fcovers.
OL,12,FThe scheme, which runs in five
OL,13,Fboroughs, will expand to 10 boroughs.
OL,15,FIt comes a month after the country
OL,16,Fsinger died at the age of 80. She set
OL,17,Fup the library in 1995 in tribute to
OL,18,Fher father, who could not read or
OL,19,Fwrite.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
